# Provenance of figures and tables

Each delivered figure (`figures/*.pdf`) and table (`tables/*.tex`) is produced
by the generator of the same name in `figures/src/` from result files committed
in `experiment-repo` (read at the commit pinned in `figures/src/data.py` via `git archive`) (or the data the objective supplies). For each output this
file records: generator, input files (repository, path, commit), and the claim
it supports. Rebuild everything with `make -C figures`, or run each `python3 figures/src/<name>.py`.
`python3 tools/check.py` compiles all outputs in the NeurIPS 2026 template and lists figure fonts.
`figures/preview/*.png` are local previews and are not delivered.

Environment: Python 3.11, matplotlib 3.11.2, numpy 2.4.6, pandas 3.0.6, scipy 1.17.1 (t quantile in fig_realdata), pymupdf 1.28.2 (tools/check.py); pinned in `requirements.txt` (`pip install -r requirements.txt`).
Fonts: STIX (Times-like), embedded as TrueType subsets (pdf.fonttype 42).

